misskey-cf is a rewrite of the Misskey backend (https://github.com/misskey-dev/misskey) for Cloudflare. Much of its code is ported from Misskey, and the web client it serves is Misskey's own, built from the pinned upstream/misskey submodule.

RsaSignature2017 implementation by Transmute Industries Inc
License: MIT
https://github.com/transmute-industries/RsaSignature2017/blob/master/LICENSE

